lcos-updates (0.9.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version moves to the LCOS 0.9.5 track.
  * Round 15 U-1: after Install, Restart is offered when the transaction
    included linux-image-*, linux-signed-*, firmware-*, linux-firmware,
    or *-microcode, even if nothing wrote
    /var/run/reboot-required. An existing reboot-required marker also
    offers Restart, and Restart stays offered after a cleanup. Clearer
    restart wording (no ". (" double punctuation).
  * U-2: Install passes APT::Keep-Downloaded-Packages=false and runs
    apt-get clean after a successful Install or Repair, so downloaded debs
    no longer pile up in /var/cache/apt/archives. Check and Install report
    packages apt-get autoremove would remove; a new "Remove Unused
    Packages" button asks for confirmation and runs the new helper command
    "cleanup" (own polkit action, auth_admin), which re-simulates and
    refuses unless the set matches exactly. Never purges.
  * U-3: AppStream metainfo (org.lunduke.LcosUpdates.metainfo.xml).

