lcos-updates (0.9.4-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Round 14 U-1: the helper no longer makes a private download folder;
    stale lcos-updates-templates.* folders left by a killed 0.9.4-5/-6
    helper are removed at start (real directories owned by root only).
  * U-2: Check downloads new packages into apt's archive cache, so Install
    and later Checks reuse them instead of downloading again.
  * U-3: a deb is never inspected when its download or checksum failed,
    file: sources included.
